    "text": "The refactoring has been implemented. Here's a summary of the design and the complete code.\n\n## Design Overview\n\n**Package layout** (`benchkit/` at repo root, sibling of `tools/`):\n\n```\nbenchkit/\n  __init__.py\n  config.py        # strict config loading + env assembly\n  process.py       # ProcessSupervisor: spawn, watchdog, cancellation, cleanup\n  artifacts.py     # ArtifactWriter: dirs, manifests, logs, JSON records\n  analysis.py      # window-union oracle (moved from tools/analyze_window_union.py)\n  analysis_tests.py# moved unittest suite\n  bench_dflash.py  # benchmark command (from tools/bench_dflash_matrix.py)\n  check_verify.py  # parity harness (from tools/check_verify_scratch.py)\ntools/\n  analyze_window_union.py   # thin shim -> benchkit.analysis\n  test_analyze_window_union.py -> benchkit.analysis_tests\n  bench_dflash_matrix.py    # shim -> benchkit.bench_dflash.main\n  check_verify_scratch.py   # shim -> benchkit.check_verify.main\ntests/\n  test_process.py\n  test_config.py\n  test_artifacts.py\n  test_bench_dflash.py\n```\n\n**",
